gnome-shell-extension-incus-monitor (1.0.0~rc.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * feat(ui): offer Show log on a failed action
  * feat(ui): show the root disk usage of an instance when Incus reports it
  * fix(ui): clear a failure notice after a later success and make the log
    view robust to pager settings
  * feat(ui): show how many instances are running at the top of the menu
  * feat(ui): show the port forwards of an instance in its expanded row
  * build: group make targets into test, build and release suites, add make
    doctor and readable output
  * feat(ui): notify when a running instance stops without a menu action
  * docs: record the design review of B3, B4 and B8
  * feat(ui): show notifications under Incus Monitor with the panel icon
    instead of System
  * fix(ui): clearer notification titles, locale-formatted counts, quieter
    screen reader names and tidier wording

